        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Toco. Uma lenda afirma que as folhas verdes de Phantump curam qualquer doença, mas elas murcham imediatamente quando arrancadas. Este Pokémon surgiu quando o espírito de uma criança falecida possuiu um toco de árvore e agora vaga pela floresta procurando amigos.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Amorfo, Grama &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Phantump pode evoluir para Trevenant no nível 12 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Confuse Ray, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Astonish, Branch Poke</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Growth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Ingrain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Feint Attack, Hex</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Leech Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Curse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Will-O-Wisp</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Forest’s Curse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Destiny Bond</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Phantom Force, Wood Hammer</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Horn Leech</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Ally Switch, Attract, Bulldoze, Confide, Confuse Ray, Curse, Dark Pulse, Dig, Double Team, Dream Eater, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Foul Play, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Hex, Hidden Power, Imprison, Lash Out, Magic Coat, Magical Leaf, Nature Power, Night Shade, Pain Split, Phantom Force, Poison Jab, Poltergeist, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Rock Slide, Role Play, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Shadow Ball, Shadow Claw, Skill Swap, Skitter Smack, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Spite, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, Trailblaze, Trick, Trick Room, Will-O-Wisp, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Ally Switch, Bestow, Disable, Grudge, Imprison, Power-Up Punch, Sucker Punch, Venom Drench</p>",
